+
+## Request
+
+Give every added task a unique, stable string identifier. Add ID lookup and allow all existing
+title-based task operations to address a task by that identifier.
+
+## Work
+
+Pending approval of the identifier-generation decision, add red-first tests, implement the public
+API and domain behavior, update documentation, and run the test suite.
